{"id": "215446", "name": "פונקציית הסתברות על הטבעיים – מציאת C מתוך P({n, n+1})", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>תהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\mathbb{P} \\)</span> פונקציית הסתברות על מרחב המדגם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( \\Omega=\\mathbb{N}=\\{0,1,2,...\\}\\)</span> כך ש</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\mathbb{P}[ \\{ n,n+1\\} ] = C\\cdot{{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:1}}^{-n-1}\\]</p><p>לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb{N}\\)</span>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> מחלקים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{N}\\)</span> לזוגות זרים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{0,1\\},\\{2,3\\},\\dots\\)</span>, וסכום ההסתברויות שלהם הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}(\\Omega)=1\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — חלוקה לזוגות</b><br>הקבוצות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\{2k,2k+1\\}\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(k=0,1,2,\\dots\\)</span>, זרות ואיחודן הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>. לפי האדיטיביות הבת-מנייה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1=\\mathbb{P}(\\Omega)=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\mathbb{P}[\\{2k,2k+1\\}]=\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}C\\cdot{{CT:0}}\\cdot{{CT:1}}^{-2k-1} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סכום הטור הגאומטרי</b><br>זה טור גאומטרי עם איבר ראשון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}^{-1}\\)</span> ומנה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:1}}^{-2}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}{{CT:1}}^{-2k-1}=\\frac{ {{CT:1}}^{-1}}{1-{{CT:1}}^{-2}}=\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:2}}-1}=\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:3}} } \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ 1=C\\cdot{{CT:0}}\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:3}} }=C\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:1}} }{ {{CT:4}} }\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad C={{CT:5}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["r", "ta"], "nvariants": 16}